    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "A\nAIR MAIL ®\nJUL\nThis cover was carried in\na caraboa-drawn cart,\n4 PM\nBeetle Nut Express,\n1937\n12 0\nfrom Dededo 5 miles to\nAgana, the capital of Guam,\nGUAN\nE\nand there postmarked.\nC\nThe Pan American Airway Co.\nI\ntransported it 8 miles by truck\nV\nSpecial Delivery\nA to thes\ntour\nClipper.\nE\nL It was flown via Wake, Midway \u0026 R\nHawaii to Alameda, Califoraia\nwhere its flight continued\nvia other airmail routes.\nSPONSORS; KRETZLER \u0026 VOSS\n*AIR \u0026MAILO\n500\nMiss I. Marion Wood,\nOverbrook,\nNew Hartford, Conn.",
